    "description": {
      "value": "<p>As a paladin, you gain the following class features.</p><h2>Hit Points</h2><p><strong>Hit Dice:</strong> 1d10 per paladin level</p><p><strong>Hit Points at 1st Level:</strong> 10 + your Constitution modifier</p><p><strong>Hit Points at Higher Levels:</strong> 1d10 (or 6) + your Constitution modifier per paladin level after 1st</p><h2>Proficiencies</h2><p><strong>Armor:</strong> All armor, shields</p><p><strong>Weapons:</strong> Simple weapons, martial weapons</p><p><strong>Tools:</strong> None</p><p><strong>Saving Throws:</strong> Wisdom, Charisma</p><p><strong>Skills:</strong> Choose two from Athletics, Insight, Intimidation, Medicine, Persuasion, and Religion</p><h2>Equipment</h2><p>You start with the following equipment, in addition to the equipment granted by your background:</p><ul><li><p>(a) a martial weapon and a shield or (b) two martial weapons</p></li><li><p>(a) a priest's pack or (b) an explorer's pack</p></li><li><p>Chain mail and a holy symbol</p></li></ul><h2>Class Table</h2><table><tbody><tr><td data-colwidth=\"51\"><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Level</strong></p></td><td data-colwidth=\"70\"><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Proficiency Bonus</strong></p></td><td><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Features</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td data-colwidth=\"51\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">1st</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"70\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">2</p></td><td><p>@UUID[Compendium.wc5e-foundryvtt.class-features.Item.V4tyeCq6gm7yGCQb]{Divine Sense}, @UUID[Compendium.wc5e-foundryvtt.class-features.Item.Kl0qA1zGS6bUlHW4]{Lay on Hands}</p></td></tr><tr><td data-colwidth=\"51\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">2nd</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"70\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">2</p></td><td><p>Fighting Style, @UUID[Compendium.wc5e-foundryvtt.class-features.Item.jENGlEb6US4quUTK]{Spellcasting},</p></td></tr><tr><td data-colwidth=\"51\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">3rd</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"70\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">2</p></td><td><p>Sacred Path</p></td></tr><tr><td data-colwidth=\"51\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">4th</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"70\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">2</p></td><td><p>ASI</p></td></tr><tr><td data-colwidth=\"51\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">5th</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"70\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">3</p></td><td><p>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.classfeatures.Item.XogoBnFWmCAHXppo]{Extra Attack}</p></td></tr><tr><td data-colwidth=\"51\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">6th</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"70\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">3</p></td><td><p>@UUID[Compendium.wc5e-foundryvtt.class-features.Item.Hg3coeCQN8CKfAnQ]{Aura of Protection}</p></td></tr><tr><td data-colwidth=\"51\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">7th</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"70\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">3</p></td><td><p>Sacred Path feature</p></td></tr><tr><td data-colwidth=\"51\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">8th</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"70\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">3</p></td><td><p>ASI</p></td></tr><tr><td data-colwidth=\"51\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">9th</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"70\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">4</p></td><td><p style=\"text-align:center\">X</p></td></tr><tr><td data-colwidth=\"51\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">10th</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"70\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">4</p></td><td><p>@UUID[Compendium.wc5e-foundryvtt.class-features.Item.ldRp8e8rWPwyC9xf]{Aura of Courage}</p></td></tr><tr><td data-colwidth=\"51\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">11th</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"70\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">4</p></td><td><p>@UUID[Compendium.wc5e-foundryvtt.class-features.Item.w40uvVUnVpuWz3p3]{Improved Crusader Strike}</p></td></tr><tr><td data-colwidth=\"51\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">12th</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"70\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">4</p></td><td><p>ASI</p></td></tr><tr><td data-colwidth=\"51\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">13th</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"70\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">5</p></td><td><p style=\"text-align:center\">X</p></td></tr><tr><td data-colwidth=\"51\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">14th</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"70\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">5</p></td><td><p>@UUID[Compendium.wc5e-foundryvtt.class-features.Item.Od8r3azHmaHO2DCn]{Cleansing Touch}</p></td></tr><tr><td data-colwidth=\"51\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">15th</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"70\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">5</p></td><td><p>Sacred Path feature</p></td></tr><tr><td data-colwidth=\"51\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">16th</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"70\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">5</p></td><td><p>ASI</p></td></tr><tr><td data-colwidth=\"51\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">17th</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"70\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">6</p></td><td><p style=\"text-align:center\">X</p></td></tr><tr><td data-colwidth=\"51\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">18th</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"70\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">6</p></td><td><p>Aura Improvements</p></td></tr><tr><td data-colwidth=\"51\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">19th</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"70\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">6</p></td><td><p>ASI</p></td></tr><tr><td data-colwidth=\"51\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">20th</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"70\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">6</p></td><td><p>Sacred Path feature</p></td></tr></tbody></table>",
